ard you do uh a  rendition of a an 80s song that josh  blew me away but  crowded house the one cover we you know  the the album is all original music  except one cover and it's the the  crowded house song from 1986 don't dream  it's over oh my gosh you know it's a  timeless song and i tried to put my spin  on it and and just it was it was wild to  me when i was listening to it and  recording it how  um  the lyrics are still so relevant today  it really is your voice is incredible  now if people want to see you you're  going to be performing yeah tell us  where you're going to be here in town  you know i i  kick off in las vegas the first of four  album release shows so that'll be this  friday the 16th at the space  i love that venue awesome venue at eight  o'clock so that's this friday and then  we go on to palm springs next week and  los angeles and then new york city we  wrap up the release shows so it's it's  an exciting few weeks now if people want  to go see the show they just have to go  to the website the spaces yep yep i  think you all have the link but if not  you can go to my website  chadwickjohnson.com and all the show  links are right there do that get the  album his album release again september  16th  as well as his uh show over at the space  show time is 8 p.m tickets more info  available at the space lv dot com thank  you so much  rocky over to you

